WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Is yesterday the same as today?

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,880
Yesterday I was working as a slimming model

3
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,240
Today is my job as a secretary

4
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,640
Temporary secretary? That's pretty much it?

5
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:08,440
Brother Tong said it’s true that he wants to find a beautiful secretary

6
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:09,520
Is she getting rich?

7
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,640
I'm not sure about this. Ask her yourself.

8
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:14,280
Brother Tong lives here, yes

9
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,280
Of course the rent here is very expensive, right?

10
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:18,320
After all, it is one of the most luxurious communities in rural areas.

11
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:21,800
What kind of house does Brother Tong rent? How much is the monthly rent for the villa she lives in?

12
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:22,920
If we talk about market price

13
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,040
The monthly rent will not be less than 100,000

14
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:26,160
What? One hundred thousand is too scary, right?

15
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:28,360
No wonder the villa is worth 45 million

16
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:29,360
forty-five million

17
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:30,640
Three points are calculated for each year of deposit in the bank.

18
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,600
It’s more than one million

19
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:34,400
But Zhang Tong is starting a business. Why doesn’t he know how to save and make a fortune?

20
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:36,160
Is it reliable to be so lavish?

21
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,760
You would know it if you got involved

22
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,400
Didn’t she give you a million-dollar annual salary?

23
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:41,080
I think you're just having fun

24
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,600
If she can't make money

25
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:45,300
Even if you give me a million-dollar annual salary, it will be in vain.

26
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,700
Then think about it yourself

27
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,340
I am a person with professional ethics

28
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:49,260
Don't even think about it from me

29
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,580
Find out about Zhang Tong’s secrets
